where $\phi(\tau)=F(\tau)^TGF(\tau)$ for Theorem 6.1's frame.
Throughout this closed interval the optimal grouped tuple is uniquely

$$
X_{-,-}=FF^T,\qquad X_{+,+}=UU^T,\qquad
X_{-,+}=WW^T,\qquad X_{+,-}=0.
